  "question": {
    "text": "The volume contraction of a solid copper cube of edge length 10 cm , when subjected to a hydraulic pressure of $7 \\times 10^6 \\mathrm{~Pa}$, would be ____ $\\mathrm{mm}^3$.\n(Given bulk modulus of copper $=1.4 \\times 10^{11} \\mathrm{~N} \\mathrm{~m}^{-2}$ )"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "50",
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned} & \\mathrm{B}=\\frac{\\Delta \\mathrm{P}}{\\frac{\\Delta \\mathrm{V}}{\\mathrm{V}}} \\\\ & \\Delta \\mathrm{V}=\\frac{7 \\times 10^6}{1.4 \\times 10^{11}} \\times\\left(10 \\times 10^{-2}\\right)^3 \\\\ & \\Delta \\mathrm{~V}=50 \\mathrm{~mm}^3\\end{aligned}$"
  }
}